### Go version

go version go1.27.3 darwin/arm64 (go1.26.5 behaves the same)

### What did you do?

Wrote an archive with one entry just over 4 GiB using `Writer.CreateHeader`, then extracted it with `ditto -x -k`, the zip extractor that ships with macOS.

```go
package main

import (
	"archive/zip"
	"bytes"
