Causes a build failure with the Perl grammar:

```
$ nix log /nix/store/dpbw6dl9nfylpykfny9zsbd8gjp8xqic-helix-tree-sitter-perl-72a08a496a23212f23802490ef6f4700d68cfd0e.drv

